p://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg>CHUYẾN ĐI TIẾP THEO</span><h3 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white font-medium group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors duration-300">Phần <!-- -->10<!-- -->: <!-- -->Điều Còn Lại</h3></div><div class="shrink-0 w-16 h-16 rounded-full border border-white/10 group-hover:border-amber-500 group-hover:bg-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 transform group-hover:translate-x-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-8 h-8 text-stone-400 group-hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></div></div></a><div class="mt-8 bg-[#0D1516] border border-[#162527] rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center relative overflow-hidden group"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url(''https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2025/11/tour-alaska-fittour.webp'')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-10 mix-blend-luminosity group-hover:opacity-20 transition-opacity duration-700"></div><div class="relative z-10 space-y-6"><span class="font-mono text-cyan-500 text-[10px] md:text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-black">TRẢI NGHIỆM THỰC TẾ</span><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl text-white font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-tight">Sẵn Sàng Chạm Vào Giấc Mơ Bắc Cực Cùng FIT TOUR?</h3><p class="text-stone-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">Khám phá Hành trình Tour Alaska 8 Ngày 7 Đêm cao cấp. Tận mắt chiêm ngưỡng sông b