Mục lục bài viết
</div>  </div> </aside>  <main class="col-span-1 lg:col-span-6 space-y-10">  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200/60 p-6 flex flex-wrap lg:flex-nowrap items-center justify-between gap-4"> <div class="absolute -top-3 left-6 bg-emerald-500 text-white text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded shadow-sm hidden">Tổng Quan Nhanh</div> <div class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-2 lg:hidden"> <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm border-l-4 border-emerald-500 pl-2 uppercase">Tổng Quan Nhanh</span> </div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-[48%] lg:w-auto"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 text-xl border border-emerald-100 shrink-0">⛰️</div> <div> <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">Vùng đất</div> <div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-800">Ladakh</div> </div> </div> <div class="hidden lg:block w-px h-8 bg-slate-200"></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-[48%] lg:w-auto"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-50 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-600 text-xl border border-blue-100 shrink-0">❄️</div> <div> <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">Độ cao TB</div> <div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-800">3.000 - 4.000m</div> </div> </div> <div class="hidden lg:block w-px h-8 bg-slate-200"></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-[48%] lg:w-auto mt-2 lg:mt-0"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-50 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-600 text-xl border border-rose-100 shrink-0">🪷</div> <div> <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">Phong cách ẩm thực</div> <div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-800">Đậm chất Tây Tạng</div> </div> </div> <div class="hidden lg:block w-px h-8 bg-slate-200"></div> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 w-[48%] lg:w-auto mt-2 lg:mt-0"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600 text-xl border border-amber-100 shrink-0">📅</div> <div> <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">Thời điểm đẹp nhất</div> <div class="text-[13px] font-bold text-slate-800">Tháng 5 – Tháng 10</div> </div> </div> </div>  <div id="gioi-thieu" class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-700 mb-10"> <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-bold text-slate-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block mb-6">Giới Thiệu</h2> <p>Bữa ăn đầu tiên ở Leh thường khiến khách Việt bất ngờ. Không phải vì cay, mà vì quá nhạt. Sau gần 10 giờ bay và vừa thích nghi với độ cao hơn 3.500m, nhiều người mong một bát phở nóng. Nhưng thứ chờ họ lại là Thukpa, Butter Tea hay Skyu – những món ăn được tạo ra để giúp con người sống giữa Himalaya lạnh giá.</p> <p>Qua hơn 80 chuyến đi và dẫn hơn 700 khách, FIT TOUR đúc kết lại cẩm nang ẩm thực này không chỉ để liệt kê món ăn, mà để giúp bạn chuẩn bị một cái dạ dày thật tốt cho chuyến đi <a href="https://fittour.vn/du-lich-ladakh" target="_blank" class="text-amber-700 font-medium hover:underline" title="Kinh nghiệm du lịch Ladakh">du lịch Ladakh</a> sắp tới.</p> <p>Một trong những điều tuyệt vời nhất khi khám phá vùng đất Tiểu Tây Tạng này là trải nghiệm ẩm thực đa dạng do chính người dân địa phương chế biến.</p> <figure> <img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/mon-an-tai-the-tibetan-kitchen-leh-ladakh.webp" alt="Món ăn tại The Tibetan Kitchen Leh Ladakh" class="w-full rounded-xl shadow-md"> <figcaption class="text-center text-sm text-slate-500 italic mt-2">Món ăn truyền thống tại <a href="https://fittour.vn/the-tibetan-kitchen-leh-ladakh" target="_blank" class="text-amber-600 hover:underline">nhà hàng The Tibetan Kitchen, Leh</a></figcaption> </figure> <p><strong><em>Xem thêm:</em></strong> <a href="/tu-vien-ladakh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Khám phá các tu viện cổ kính ở Ladakh</a>.</p> </div> <!-- Bảng Tổng Hợp --> <div class="mb-12 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm"> <div class="bg-amber-50 px-6 py-4 border-b border-amber-100"> <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900">Bảng Tóm Tắt Món Ăn Ladakh</h3> </div> <div class="overflow-x-auto"> <table class="w-full text-left text-sm text-slate-700"> <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 font-medium"> <tr> <th class="px-6 py-4">Món</th> <th class="px-6 py-4">Nên thử</th> <th class="px-6 py-4">Vị / Ghi chú</th> <th class="px-6 py-4">Giá tham khảo</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100"> <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"> <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Thukpa</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-amber-500">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td> <td class="px-6 py-4">dễ ăn, ấm bụng</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-slate-500">₹150-200</td> </tr><tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"> <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Momos (Gà/Rau)</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-amber-500">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td> <td class="px-6 py-4">giống há cảo, quen thuộc</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-slate-500">₹100-150</td> </tr><tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"> <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Skyu</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-amber-500">⭐⭐⭐</td> <td class="px-6 py-4">lạ miệng, nhiều tinh bột</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-slate-500">₹150-250</td> </tr><tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"> <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Butter Tea (Trà bơ)</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-amber-500">⭐⭐</td> <td class="px-6 py-4">mặn, béo ngậy, khó uống</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-slate-500">₹50-80</td> </tr><tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors"> <td class="px-6 py-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Yak Cheese (Chhurpe)</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-amber-500">⭐⭐</td> <td class="px-6 py-4">cứng, chua nhẹ, đậm mùi</td> <td class="px-6 py-4 text-slate-500">₹100-200</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </div> <!-- Khẩu vị người Việt --> <div class="mb-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"> <div class="bg-emerald-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-emerald-100"> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thumbs-up w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5.88 14 10h5.83a2 2 0 0 1 1.92 2.56l-2.33 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 22H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.76a2 2 0 0 0 1.79-1.11L12 2a3.13 3.13 0 0 1 3 3.88Z"></path><path d="M7 10v12"></path></svg> </div> <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-900">Nên ăn ngay</h3> </div> <ul class="space-y-3"> <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-emerald-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg> <span>Thukpa (Mì nước Tây Tạng)</span> </li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-emerald-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg> <span>Chicken Momos (Há cảo gà)</span> </li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-emerald-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg> <span>Yak Fried Rice (Cơm rang thịt Yak)</span> </li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-emerald-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg> <span>Khambir (Bánh mì ăn kèm trứng ốp la)</span> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-amber-100"> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg> </div> <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-900">Chuẩn bị tinh thần</h3> </div> <ul class="space-y-3"> <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-amber-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg> <span>Butter Tea (Trà bơ mặn)</span> </li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-amber-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg> <span>Tsampa (Bột lúa mạch rang - khá khô)</span> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="bg-rose-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-rose-100"> <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"> <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-rose-100 flex items-center justify-center text-rose-600"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg> </div> <h3 class="font-bold text-rose-900">Tránh lúc say độ cao</h3> </div> <ul class="space-y-3"> <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-rose-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-rose-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg> <span>Các món quá cay (như tương ớt đỏ)</span> </li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-rose-800 text-sm"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-rose-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg> <span>Quá nhiều thịt Yak hoặc bơ (dễ gây đầy bụng khi đang say độ cao)</span> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="flex items-center justify-center py-4 opacity-40"> <div class="w-16 h-px bg-slate-400"></div> <span class="mx-4 text-amber-600 text-xl">🪷</span> <div class="w-16 h-px bg-slate-400"></div> </div>  <div id="danh-sach-18-tu-vien" class="space-y-16"> <div id="momos" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow mb-12 scroll-mt-28"> <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8"> <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500 to-amber-600 text-white font-serif font-bold text-2xl flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl shadow-lg shrink-0"> 1 </div> <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl lg:text-[28px] font-bold text-slate-900 m-0">Momos</h2> </div>  <div class="space-y-8">  <div class="flex justify-center w-full max-w-[540px] mx-auto overflow-hidden rounded-xl"> <div class="w-full"><blockquote class="instagram-media" data-instgrm-permalink="https://www.instagram.com/p/CcrwQiyPVeB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" data-instgrm-version="14" style=" background:#FFF; border:0; border-radius:3px; box-shadow:0 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.5),0 1px 10px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.15); margin: 1px; max-width:540px; min-width:326px; padding:0; width:99.375%; width:-webkit-calc(100% - 2px); width:calc(100% - 2px);"><div style="padding:16px;"> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/CcrwQiyPVeB/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading" style=" background:#FFFFFF; line-height:0; padding:0 0; text-align:center; text-decoration:none; width:100%;" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> <div style=" display: flex; flex-direction: row; align-items: center;"> <div style="background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 50%; flex-grow: 0; height: 40px; margin-right: 14px; width: 40px;"></div> <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center;"> <div style=" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 100px;"></div> <div style=" backgroun