ull mt-1 inline-block border border-amber-200">3,500m</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6"><div class="bg-stone-900/5 border border-stone-950/5 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thermometer w-4 h-4 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4v10.54a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0Z"></path></svg><div><span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-stone-400 block uppercase">Nhiệt độ</span><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-800">10°C đến 22°C</span></div></div><div class="bg-stone-900/5 border border-stone-950/5 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg><div><span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-stone-400 block uppercase">Hiệu ứng</span><span class="text-xs font-sans text-stone-700 leading-tight font-medium block overflow-hidden truncate">Tiếng chuông xe đạp &amp; Cười đùa</span></div></div></div><div><h4 class="font-serif text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800 italic mb-2">Thời điểm vàng: 16h00 - 19h00</h4><p class="font-serif text-stone-700 text-sm leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 border-amber-700/30 pl-4 py-1">"<!-- -->Đến đây lúc chiều tà, vừa dạo chợ mua khăn Yak vừa có thể nhìn thấy cung điện Leh lấp lánh sừng sững đằng xa.<!-- -->"</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-amber-900/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-stone-400"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5