-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Cẩm Nang Mua Sắm Bỏ Túi</h2><div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-amber-700 mx-auto mt-4"></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="border rounded-xl transition-colors duration-300 border-amber-700/30 bg-stone-50"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left focus:outline-none"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-amber-100 text-amber-800"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shopping-bag w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path><path d="M3.103 6.034h17.794"></path><path d="M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z"></path></svg></div><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Đi chợ Leh có thể mặc cả không?</span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-stone-400 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="overflow-hidden" style="height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="p-5 pt-0 pl-[60px] text-stone-600 font-sans leading-relaxed">Bạn có thể mặc cả nhẹ nhàng khoảng 10-20% tại các sạp vỉa hè hoặc cửa hàng tư nhân. Tuy nhiên, tại các cửa hàng hợp tác xã của chính quyền (Government Emporium) hoặc hiệu thuốc mỹ phẩm, mọi mặt hàng đều bán đúng giá niêm yết (Fixed Price).</div></div></div><div class="border rounded-xl transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-200 bg-white hover:border-amber-700/20"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left focus:outline-none"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-credit-card w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line></svg></div><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Có thể thanh toán bằng thẻ hay cần chuẩn bị tiền mặt?</span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-stone-400 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="border rounded-xl transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-200 bg-white hover:border-amber-700/20"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left focus:outline-none"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg></div><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Thời gian tốt nhất để đi dạo mua sắm ở chợ là khi nào?</span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-stone-400 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div><div class="border rounded-xl transition-colors duration-300 border-stone-200 bg-white hover:border-amber-700/20"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-5 text-left focus:outline-none"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-gift w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M20 11v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-8"></path><path d="M7.5 7a1 1 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 7a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 1 1 0 0 1 0 5"></path><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="4" rx="1"></rect></svg></div><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-stone-900">Nên mua gì về làm quà gọn nhẹ và ý nghĩa nhất?</span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5 text-stone-400 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section id="guestbook-section" class="relative py-24 px-4 bg-amber-50/30 border-t border-amber-900/10"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-16"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-900 font-bold block mb-2">Góc Chia Sẻ Trải Nghiệm</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight">Cẩm Nang Bỏ Túi &amp; Trải Nghiệm Thực Tế</h2><div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-amber-700 mx-auto mt-4 mb-4"></div><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm text-stone-600 font-sans">Chia sẻ những kỷ niệm mua sắm thú vị và kinh nghiệm dạo chợ thực tế từ chuyến đi của bạn.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-amber-900/10 relative h-fit"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-6"><div class="h-9 w-9 bg-amber-700/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-amber-800"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-4.5 h-4.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path><path d="M20 2v4"></path><path d="M22 4h-4"></path><circle cx="4" cy="20" r="2"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900">Viết Tiếp Hành Trình</h3></div><div class="space-y-4"><p class="text-sm font-sans text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Chợ Leh - bức tranh thu nhỏ của nhịp sống bản địa giữa lòng Himalaya. Từng con hẻm, từng sạp hàng đều mang theo câu chuyện của người vùng cao.</p><p class="text-sm font-sans text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Hãy để <b>FIT Tour</b> đồng hành cùng bạn trên cung đường Ladakh huyền thoại, nơi mọi giới hạn tuổi tác và sức khỏe đều có thể được vượt qua bằng ý chí và sự chuẩn bị kỹ lưỡng từ đội ngũ tổ chức chuyên nghiệp.</p><a href="/tour/tour-ladakh-roadtrip/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-amber-700 hover:bg-amber-800 text-amber-50 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm font-mono tracking-wider uppercase font-semibold transition shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>Tham Khảo Tour Ladakh</a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-12 xl:col-span-7 space-y-4 max-h-[520px] overflow-y-auto pr-2 no-scrollbar border-t md:border-t-0 pt-6 md:pt-0"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-250/20 pb-3 mb-2"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wide flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smile w-4.5 h-4.5 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"></path><line x1="9" x2="9.01" y1="9" y2="9"></line><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="9" y2="9"></line></svg>Tổng số lời chúc hiện tại: <b>0</b></span><span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 italic">Kéo xuống để xem thêm</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 px-4 bg-white border-t border-stone-200"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-12"><div><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold block mb-2">Đọc Thêm</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight">Có Thể Bạn Quan Tâm</h2></div><div class="hidden md:block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open w-8 h-8 text-stone-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><a href="https://fittour.vn/vi-sao-ladakh-duoc-goi-la-tieu-tay-tang" target="_blank" class="group flex flex-col bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200/60 hover:border-amber-700/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden relative"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2023/06/Dang-Thuy-Duong-kham-pha-tu-vien-Hemis.webp" alt="Vì Sao Ladakh Được Gọi Là Tiểu Tây Tạng Của Ấn Độ?" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div></div><div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-500 mb-4"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Tháng 6, 2026</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>10 phút đọc</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">Vì Sao Ladakh Được Gọi Là Tiểu Tây Tạng Của Ấn Độ?</h3><p class="text-sm font-sans text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">Khám phá sự tương đồng sâu sắc về địa lý, văn hóa, tôn giáo và lối sống với vùng đất thiêng Tây Tạng qua những tu viện hàng trăm năm tuổi.</p><div class="flex items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest mt-auto">Đọc ngay <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="https://fittour.vn/mac-gi-khi-di-du-lich-ladakh" target="_blank" class="group flex flex-col bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200/60 hover:border-amber-700/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden relative"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/co-gai-chup-anh-tren-xe-roadtrip-ladakh-truoc-tu-vien-thiksey.webp" alt="Mặc gì khi đi du lịch Ladakh để lên hình đẹp nhất?" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div></div><div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-500 mb-4"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Tháng 5, 2026</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>7 phút đọc</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">Mặc gì khi đi du lịch Ladakh để lên hình đẹp nhất?</h3><p class="text-sm font-sans text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">Ladakh có bảng màu đặc biệt, một bộ đồ phù hợp với bối cảnh sẽ tạo nên những bức ảnh để đời. Kinh nghiệm chọn trang phục roadtrip phóng khoáng.</p><div class="flex items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest mt-auto">Đọc ngay <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a></div></div></section><section class="relative py-16 px-4 bg-stone-50 border-t border-stone-200"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto"><div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-900 to-stone-900 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl relative"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-amber-700/20 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 items-center relative z-10"><div class="p-8 md:p-12 text-left"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-amber-300 uppercase font-bold bg-amber-900/50 border border-amber-500/30 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-star w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-amber-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z"></path></svg>Sản Phẩm Signature</div><h3 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4">Ladakh Series</h3><p class="text-stone-300 font-sans text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">Tự hào là đơn vị tiên phong với kinh nghiệm tổ chức chuyên nghiệp, <strong>FIT Tour</strong> mang đến chuỗi hành trình khám phá Tiểu Tây Tạng độc quyền, thiết kế riêng để đảm bảo sức khỏe và trải nghiệm tối ưu cho mọi lứa tuổi.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3"><a href="https://fittour.vn/country/ladakh/" target="_blank" class="bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(245,158,11,0.3)] flex items-center justify-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg>Xem Series Ladakh</a><a href="https://fittour.vn/tour/tour-ladakh-roadtrip/" target="_blank" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/20 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http