duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Fort Road (Đổi tiền)<!-- --> (<!-- -->3,500m<!-- -->)</span></button><button id="map-node-loc-3" style="left:70%;top:30%" class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 group"><span class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-full border transition-all duration-300 border-transparent scale-50 group-hover:scale-100 group-hover:border-stone-700/50"></span><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700"><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold font-semibold">3</span></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-9 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Quầy bán đồ bạc (Ngã ba)<!-- --> (<!-- -->3,500m<!-- -->)</span></button><div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-stone-600 select-none opacity-40 pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass w-10 h-10" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-stone-800 text-xs font-mono"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-400"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-600"></span><span>Điểm Xuất Phát: <b>Leh City</b></span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 text-stone-600 self-center hidden sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-400"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span><span>Điểm Cuối: <b>Pangong Lake</b></span></div><div class="ml-auto text-amber-500/80 italic font-serif">Hành trình dài hơn 420 km đèo đá hiểm trở</div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between"><div id="journal-paper-card" class="bg-amber-50 shadow-lg border border-amber-950/10 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between h-full relative" style="background-image:radial-gradient(#fbf0d9 0.5px, transparent 0.5px);background-size:16px 16px;opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)"><div class="absolute -left-3 top-6 bottom-6 w-1 flex flex-col justify-between items-center pointer-events-none"><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between items-start border-b border-amber-900/10 pb-4 mb-5"><div><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-800 tracking-wider font-bold">LADAKH MEMORIES JOURNAL</span><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-1">Main Bazaar Leh</h3></div><div class="text-right"><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-400 block">Độ Cao</span><span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mt-1 inline-block border border-amber-200">3,500m</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6"><div class="bg-stone-900/5 border border-stone-950/5 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thermometer w-4 h-4 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4v10.54a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0Z"></path></svg><div><span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-stone-400 block uppercase">Nhiệt độ</span><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-800">10°C đến 22°C</span></div></div><div class="bg-stone-900/5 border border-stone-950/5 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg><div><span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-stone-400 block uppercase">Hiệu ứng</span><span class="text-xs font-sans text-stone-700 leading-tight font-medium block overflow-hidden truncate">Tiếng chuông xe đạp &amp; Cười đùa</span></div></div></div><div><h4 class="font-serif text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800 italic mb-2">Thời điểm vàng: 16h00 - 19h00</h4><p class="font-serif text-stone-700 text-sm leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 border-amber-700/30 pl-4 py-1">"<!-- -->Đến đây lúc chiều tà, vừa dạo chợ mua khăn Yak vừa có thể nhìn thấy cung điện Leh lấp lánh sừng sững đằng xa.<!-- -->"</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-amber-900/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-stone-400"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-amber-600 rounded-full"></span><span>Nhật ký hành trình</span></div><div class="flex gap-1.5"><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-amber-700 text-amber-50 border-amber-700 font-bold scale-110">1</button><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-white opacity-60 border-stone-300 text-stone-600 hover:opacity-100">2</button><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-white opacity-60 border-stone-300 text-stone-600 hover:opacity-100">3</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="backpack-section" class="relative py-24 px-4 bg-stone-900 text-stone-150 border-t border-stone-800"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-orange-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-16"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-500 font-bold block mb-2">Hành Trang Đi Chợ</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">Túi Đồ Thiết Yếu Khi Dạo Chợ Leh</h2><div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-amber-500 mx-auto mt-4 mb-4"></div><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm text-stone-400 font-sans">Dạo bước trên phố cổ đi bộ, dưới đây là những vật dụng thiết yếu bạn nên chuẩn bị sẵn trong túi cá nhân để có một buổi chiều mua sắm trọn vẹn và an toàn nhất.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-10"><button class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-mono transition-all duration-300 bg-amber-500 text-stone-950 font-bold shadow-md"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-