ATURE OF MEMORY</span> <span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold italic text-amber-400 font-medium tracking-wide"> <!-- -->Hành Trình Xe Máy<!-- --> </span> </div> <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-400 border border-stone-800/80 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-center bg-stone-900"> <!-- -->Câu chuyện Biker<!-- --> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class="portrait-content-item col-start-1 row-start-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center transition-all duration-700 opacity-0 z-0 pointer-events-none scale-95"> <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-8 order-2 lg:order-1"> <div class="space-y-1"> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest block">CHÂN DUNG KHẮC HỌA</span> <p class="font-serif text-2xl font-semibold text-white leading-tight"> <!-- -->Pangong<!-- --> </p> <div class="h-0.5 w-12 bg-amber-500 mt-2"></div> </div> <div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-stone-400"> <div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-900"> <span>Bộ sưu tập</span> <span class="text-white font-bold">Ladakh 2026</span> </div> <div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-900"> <span>Hình thái</span> <span class="text-white font-semibold">Tự truyện du ký</span> </div> <div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-900"> <span>Độ cao trung bình</span> <span class="text-white font-semibold">&gt; 3,500m</span> </div> <div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-900"> <span>Chuyên mục</span> <span class="text-white font-semibold">Nhật ký FIT Tour</span> </div> </div> <div class="bg-stone-900/60 border border-stone-800 p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-xs text-stone-300 space-y-2"> <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-500 font-bold text-[10px]"> <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-amber-500 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>BẢN ĐỒ TỌA ĐỘ</div> <div> <span class="text-stone-400 text-[10px] uppercase block">Ladakh GPS Point</span> <span class="text-white font-bold">33.7225° N, 78.9158° E</span> </div> <div> <span class="text-stone-400 text-[10px] uppercase block">Định danh</span> <span class="text-stone-300 italic">Pangong &amp; Nubra</span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-1 lg:order-2"> <div class="relative aspect-3/4 w-full max-w-[370px] bg-stone-900 border-4 border-amber-500/20 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-4 overflow-hidden group" style="box-shadow:0 25px 50px -12px rgba(218, 175, 90, 0.15)"> <div class="absolute inset-2 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl z-20 pointer-events-none"></div> <img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/bien-may-duoi-day-nui-himalaya-ladakh.webp" alt="BẦU TRỜI GẦN MẶT ĐẤT" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover grayscale-[20%] group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700 brightness-[85%] scale-102 group-hover:scale-105"> <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-stone-950 via-stone-950/20 to-transparent z-10"></div> <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 z-20 text-white font-serif pointer-events-none"> <span class="font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 block font-semibold">FIT TOUR EXCLUSIVE</span> <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-0.5 drop-shadow">DIARY</h3> </div> <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 z-20 text-right font-mono text-[8px] text-white/70 pointer-events-none"> <span>ISSUE 03</span> <span class="block mt-0.5 text-amber-400 font-bold bg-amber-400/10 px-1 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-400/20 uppercase"> <!-- -->THE STARGAZER<!-- --> </span> </div> <div class="absolute bottom-6 inset-x-6 z-20 text-left pointer-events-none"> <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[8px] text-amber-400 font-mono tracking-widest block mb-1"> <span>PORTRAIT SPREAD</span> <span>•</span> <span>STORY</span> </div> <h4 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold leading-tight uppercase tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-md"> <!-- -->BẦU TRỜI GẦN MẶT ĐẤT<!-- --> </h4> <p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-stone-300 line-clamp-2 mt-1.5 italic font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-95">"Khám phá Ladakh qua Pangong, Nubra, những con đèo hùng vĩ và các câu chuyện đời thường khiến hành trình ở lại rất lâu trong ký ức."</p> </div> <a href="/nhat-ky-kham-pha-ladakh" aria-label="Đọc nhật ký hành trình Pangong" class="absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-[2px]"> <span class="px-6 py-3 border border-amber-500 text-amber-400 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest bg-stone-900/80 hover:bg-amber-500 hover:text-stone-900 transition-colors rounded-full font-bold">Đọc Nhật Ký Hành Trình</span> </a> <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-5 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white via-stone-900 to-black z-15"></div> </div> </div> <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6 order-3"> <div class="bg-stone-900/40 border border-stone-850 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl relative"> <h4 class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-400 font-bold block mb-4">Trích Đoạn Hành Trình</h4> <div class="space-y-4"> <p class="font-serif text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-200 leading-relaxed italic">"Khám phá Ladakh qua Pangong, Nubra, những con đèo hùng vĩ và các câu chuyện đời thường khiến hành trình ở lại rất lâu trong ký ức."</p> <div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-800 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono"> <span class="text-stone-400">Đọc toàn bộ bài viết</span> <a href="/nhat-ky-kham-pha-ladakh" aria-label="Đọc bài viết Pangong tại đây" class="text-amber-500 hover:text-amber-400 underline font-bold block">Tại đây</a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="p-4 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-between"> <div> <span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-stone-400 block">SIGNATURE OF MEMORY</span> <span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold italic text-amber-400 font-medium tracking-wide"> <!-- -->Khám Phá Ladakh<!-- --> </span> </div> <div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-400 border border-stone-800/80 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-center bg-stone-900"> <!-- -->Ghi chép hành trình<!-- --> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="py-24 border-b border-stone-300 px-4 sm:px-12 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6"><div class="space-y-2"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-widest block font-bold">WISH WALL &amp; VOICES</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-stone-950 leading-tight">Cảm Nhận Từ Những Đôi Chân Từng Leo Đèo</h2><div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-stone-950"></div></div><div class="bg-[#FAF9F5] border border-stone-200 p-8 sm:p-10 relative rounded text-left"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote absolute right-10 bottom-6 w-20 h-20 text-stone-200/50 pointer-events-none select-none z-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><div class="relative z-10 space-y-4"><p class="font-serif text-stone-850 text-stone-800 italic leading-relaxed text-base sm:text-base text-justify">“<!-- -->Tôi từng đọc hàng chục bài viết kinh nghiệm và tự túc đầy dông dài trên mạng, nhưng bước chân vào hành trình của Fit Tour mới thấu chữ Chuyên Nghiệp. Từ sự ân cần của các local leader bản địa đến bếp lửa tự nấu phở ấm sực giữa đỉnh đèo Nubra dã ngoại. 80 chuyến đi của các bạn là bề dày của sự uy tín thực chứng.<!-- -->”</p><div class="pt-6 border-t border-stone-250/60 border-stone-200 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-between items-end"><div><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-amber-800 font-extrabold uppercase block tracking-wider">Hành Khách Chuyến Thứ 15</span><strong class="text-stone-950 font-serif text-xs italic">Nhà báo Hồng Hạnh (Báo Du Lịch, Hà Nội)</strong></div><div class="flex items-center"><button aria-label="Xem nhận xét của Nhà báo Hồng Hạnh (Báo Du Lịch, Hà Nội)" class="min-w-[48px] min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer group focus:outline-none"><span class="block h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-stone-950 w-6"></span></button><button aria-label="Xem nhận xét của Chú Phạm Thế Cường (69 tuổi, Bình Thạnh, TP.HCM)" class="min-w-[48px] min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer group focus:outline-none"><span class="block h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-stone-200 group-hover:bg-stone-300 w-2"></span></button><button aria-label="Xem nhận xét của TS. Nguyễn Hoàng Anh (Đại học Quốc gia Hà Nội)" class="min-w-[48px] min-h-[48px] flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer group focus:outline-none"><span class="block h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-stone-200 group-hover:bg-stone-300 w-2"></span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200 p-8 rounded space-y-6 text-left"><div><span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-widest block font-bold">REGISTRY LOG BOOK</span><h3 class="font-serif font-black text-stone-950 text-xl leading-tight">Bảng Lưu Bút Kỷ Định Mốc Vàng</h3><p class="text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mt-1">Nếu bạn là lữ khách cũ, hay đang háo hức cho hành trình thong dong cảm ngộ Ladakh cùng Fit Tour, xin hãy gửi lại lời chúc tâm tình:</p></div><form class="space-y-4 text-xs font-sans"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div><label for="registry-name" class="block text-stone-500 font-mono text-[9px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Họ &amp; Tên:</label><input id="registry-name" type="text" required="" placeholder="Ví dụ: Hoàng Minh Long" class="w-full bg-white border border-stone-200 hover:border-stone-300 outline-none p-2.5 rounded text-stone-800 transition text-xs" value=""></div><div><label for="registry-year" class="block text-stone-500 font-mono text-[9px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Năm Hành Trình kỉ niệm:</label><select id="registry-year" class="w-full bg-white border border-stone-200 outline-none p-2.5 rounded text-stone-600 transition text-xs font-semibold"><option value="2026" selected="">2026 (Chuyến 80)</option><option value="2025">2025 (Chặng 70)</option><option value="2024">2024</option><option value="2023">2023</option><option value="Khac">Độc giả mến mộ</option></select></div></div><div><label class="block text-stone-500 font-mono text-[9px] mb-1 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">Lưu bút chúc viết (Cột mốc thực chứng):</label><textarea required="" rows="3" placeholder="Tuyệt vời nhất là bát phở bò sực sưởi giữa đèo cùng tiếng tấu của local guide bản xứ..." class="w-full bg-white border border-stone-200 hover:border-stone-300 outline-none p-2.5 rounded text-stone-800 transition text-xs resize-none"></textarea></div><button type="submit" class="w-full py-3 bg-stone-950 hover:bg-stone-800 text-stone-100 hover:text-white font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition text-center cursor-pointer text-xs">GHI LƯU PHỔ KỶ NIỆM</button></form></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 border-b border-stone-300 px-4 sm:px-12 bg-stone-50/50"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-12 text-left"><div class="text-center space-y-2"><span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">COMMON INQUIRIES</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-black text-stone-950">Đặt Câu Hỏi Chuyên Sâu Về Điểm Đi 80 Chuyến</h2></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-base font-bold text-stone-950"><span>Vì sao con số 80 chuyến đi giúp tạo nên kết nối và trải nghiệm chân thực vượt mức thông thường?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-5 h-5 text-stone-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></div><p class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans text-justify">Trải nghiệm từ 80 lần hạ trại thực tế giúp chúng tôi xây dựng liên minh vô giá với những thủ lĩnh local guide cự phách và lái xe bản xứ dạn sương. Từ đó chúng tôi thiết kế nhịp độ bách bộ thoải mái nhất, tự tay nhóm lửa dã dã lý sưởi ấm gia vị phở Việt thân tình, mang đến linh hồn văn hóa Ladakh trung thực thay vì cách chạy sô hời hợt.</p></div><div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 rounded p-6 shadow-sm"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 font-serif text-base font-bold text-stone-950"><span>Quy chuẩn lều Glamping tại Pangong Tso giữ ấm thế nào giữa âm 10 độ?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-5 h-5 text-stone-400 shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></div><p class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 text-sm sm:text-base text-stone-600 leading-relaxed font-sans text-justify">Trải qua 80 chuyến đi thực tế, Fit Tour loại bỏ hoàn toàn dòng lều chất lượng mỏng. Chúng tôi sử dụng lều Glamping cách nhiệt cao cấp kép, lắp đặt hệ thống đệm đơm sưởi nhiệt điện chạy suốt 12 giờ đêm, cung cấp chăn lông tuyết ấm áp, biến đêm lạnh mệt mỏi thành giấc ngủ êm dịu phục hồi thể lực.</p></div></div></div></section></div></div><section id="memory-map-section" class="relative bg-amber-50/50 py-20 px-4 md:px-8 border-y border-amber-900/10"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-12"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold block mb-2">Đại Bản Đồ Số</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight">Khắc Họa Đường Băng Tuyết &amp; Sỏi Đá</h2><div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-amber-700 mx-auto mt-4 mb-4"></div><p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm text-stone-600 font-sans">Bấm chọn từng tọa độ dừng chân trên bản đồ hành trình hiểm trở để xem trang nhật ký ký ức, nhiệt độ thực tế, cùng độ cao rợn ngợp của dãy Tây Tạng mà đội ngũ FIT Tour đã an tâm dẫn lối.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-stretch"><div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-stone-900 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-stone-800"><div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[140%] h-[140%] opacity-15 pointer-events-none"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-full h-full text-amber-400 stroke-1 stroke-current fill-none"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="10" stroke-dasharray="1 3"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="20" stroke-dasharray="2 2"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="30" stroke-dasharray="3 4"></circle><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="40" stroke-dasharray="4 2"></circle><path d="M 0,50 L 100,50 M 50,0 L 50,100" stroke-width="0.2"></path></svg></div><div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-800 pb-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 animate-spin-slow" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-300 font-semibold">Ladakh Route Map</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-500/20"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-pulse"></span>ACTIVE MONITOR</div></div><div class="relative aspect-16/10 w-full bg-stone-950/80 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 p-2"><svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-10"><path d="M 25,70 L 38,76 L 45,35 L 60,22 L 88,55" fill="none" stroke="#daaf5a" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="0 1" pathLength="1" stroke-dashoffset="0"></path><path d="M 25,70 L 38,76 L 45,35 L 60,22 L 88,55" fill="none" stroke="#ce902f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="opacity-10"></path></svg><div class="absolute bottom-3 left-4 z-10 text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-500 flex flex-col gap-0.5 pointer-events-none"><span>Rặng Karakoram-Himalaya Bản Đồ Địa Hình</span><span>Tọa độ viễn du thực tế trong lộ trình 80 chuyến đi</span></div><button id="map-node-loc-1" style="left:25%;top:70%" class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 group"><span class="absolute -inset-4 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 animate-ping duration-1000"></span><span class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-full border transition-all duration-300 border-amber-500/50 scale-100"></span><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 bg-amber-500 text-stone-950 scale-110"><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold font-semibold">1</span></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-9 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Leh City<!-- --> (<!-- -->3,500m<!-- -->)</span></button><button id="map-node-loc-2" style="left:38%;top:76%" class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 group"><span class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-full border transition-all duration-300 border-transparent scale-50 group-hover:scale-100 group-hover:border-stone-700/50"></span><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700"><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold font-semibold">2</span></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-9 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Zanskar Valley<!-- --> (<!-- -->3,800m<!-- -->)</span></button><button id="map-node-loc-3" style="left:45%;top:35%" class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 group"><span class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-full border transition-all duration-300 border-transparent scale-50 group-hover:scale-100 group-hover:border-stone-700/50"></span><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700"><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold font-semibold">3</span></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-9 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Khardung La Pass<!-- --> (<!-- -->5,359m<!-- -->)</span></button><button id="map-node-loc-4" style="left:60%;top:22%" class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 group"><span class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-full border transition-all duration-300 border-transparent scale-50 group-hover:scale-100 group-hover:border-stone-700/50"></span><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700"><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold font-semibold">4</span></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-9 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Nubra Valley<!-- --> (<!-- -->3,000m<!-- -->)</span></button><button id="map-node-loc-5" style="left:88%;top:55%" class="absolute -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-20 group"><span class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-full border transition-all duration-300 border-transparent scale-50 group-hover:scale-100 group-hover:border-stone-700/50"></span><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-8 w-8 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-300 group-hover:text-amber-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700"><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold font-semibold">5</span></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-9 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 scale-0 group-hover:scale-100 transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-900 border border-stone-800 text-[10px] text-amber-50 rounded px-2 py-0.5 whitespace-nowrap shadow-md z-30 font-serif">Pangong Tso Lake<!-- --> (<!-- -->4,225m<!-- -->)</span></button><div class="absolute top-4 right-4 text-stone-600 select-none opacity-40 pointer-events-none"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass w-10 h-10" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="relative z-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-stone-800 text-xs font-mono"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-400"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-stone-600"></span><span>Điểm Xuất Phát: <b>Leh City</b></span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 text-stone-600 self-center hidden sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-400"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span><span>Điểm Cuối: <b>Pangong Lake</b></span></div><div class="ml-auto text-amber-500/80 italic font-serif">Hành trình dài hơn 420 km đèo đá hiểm trở</div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between"><div id="journal-paper-card" class="bg-amber-50 shadow-lg border border-amber-950/10 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between h-full relative" style="background-image:radial-gradient(#fbf0d9 0.5px, transparent 0.5px);background-size:16px 16px;opacity:0;transform:translateX(20px)"><div class="absolute -left-3 top-6 bottom-6 w-1 flex flex-col justify-between items-center pointer-events-none"><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div><div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full border border-stone-300 bg-stone-200 shadow-inner -ml-1"></div></div><div><div class="flex justify-between items-start border-b border-amber-900/10 pb-4 mb-5"><div><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-800 tracking-wider font-bold">LADAKH MEMORIES JOURNAL</span><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-1">Leh City</h3></div><div class="text-right"><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-500 block">Độ Cao</span><span class="font-mono text-sm font-bold text-amber-700 bg-amber-100/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full mt-1 inline-block border border-amber-200">3,500m</span></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-6"><div class="bg-stone-900/5 border border-stone-950/5 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-thermometer w-4 h-4 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4v10.54a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0Z"></path></svg><div><span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-stone-500 block uppercase">Nhiệt độ</span><span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-stone-800">5°C đến 18°C</span></div></div><div class="bg-stone-900/5 border border-stone-950/5 rounded-xl p-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg><div><span class="text-[9px] font-mono text-stone-500 block uppercase">Hiệu ứng</span><span class="text-xs font-sans text-stone-700 leading-tight font-medium block overflow-hidden truncate">Nhịp sống thị trấn &amp; Chuông đồng</span></div></div></div><div><h4 class="font-serif text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800 italic mb-2">Điểm khởi đầu: Thích nghi êm ái</h4><p class="font-serif text-stone-700 text-sm leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 border-amber-700/30 pl-4 py-1">"<!-- -->Đón đoàn tại sân bay Leh. Hướng dẫn viên sắp xếp nghỉ ngơi tại khách sạn boutique, dùng trà gừng, nhịp bách bộ thong thả để làm quen khí áp.<!-- -->"</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-amber-900/10 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-stone-500"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-amber-600 rounded-full"></span><span>Nhật ký hành trình từ Trưởng đoàn FIT Tour</span></div><div class="flex gap-1.5"><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-amber-700 text-amber-50 border-amber-700 font-bold scale-110">1</button><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-white opacity-60 border-stone-300 text-stone-600 hover:opacity-100">2</button><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-white opacity-60 border-stone-300 text-stone-600 hover:opacity-100">3</button><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-white opacity-60 border-stone-300 text-stone-600 hover:opacity-100">4</button><button class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-[9px] border transition-all bg-white opacity-60 border-stone-300 text-stone-600 hover:opacity-100">5</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="gallery-section" class="relative py-24 px-4 bg-stone-50"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-16"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold 