 viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="group relative flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.12)] transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-[45%] md:w-[35%] lg:w-[28%] snap-center"><div class="relative h-48 md:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden shrink-0"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2021/11/cuoi-lac-da-xuyen-qua-nubra-valley-ladakh.webp" alt="Thung Lũng Nubra" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1"><div class="mb-4"><span class="bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Immersive Journey</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors">06. Thung Lũng Nubra</h3><p class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">Ốc đảo xanh giữa sa mạc cát tuyết, nơi bạn có thể cưỡi lạc đà hai bướu Bactrian dạo bước trên đồi cát Hunder.</p><div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">Beyond The Trail</span><a href="/thung-lung-nubra/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-stone-900 hover:bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors">Chi Tiết <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="group relative flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.12)] transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-[45%] md:w-[35%] lg:w-[28%] snap-center"><div class="relative h-48 md:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden shrink-0"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2021/11/tu-vien-Diskit-Gompa.webp" alt="Tu Viện Diskit" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1"><div class="mb-4"><span class="bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Spiritual Journey</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors">07. Tu Viện Diskit</h3><p class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">Tu viện cổ nhất thung lũng Nubra với bức tượng Phật Di Lặc khổng lồ 32m rực rỡ sắc màu hướng ra dòng sông Shyok.</p><div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">Beyond The Trail</span><a href="/tu-vien-diskit/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-stone-900 hover:bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors">Chi Tiết <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="group relative flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.12)] transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-[45%] md:w-[35%] lg:w-[28%] snap-center"><div class="relative h-48 md:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden shrink-0"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2024/06/canh-quan-hoang-so-ho-pangong.webp" alt="Hồ Pangong Tso" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1"><div class="mb-4"><span class="bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Immersive Journey</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors">08. Hồ Pangong Tso</h3><p class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">Hồ nước lợ lớn nhất dãy Himalaya, đổi màu ảo diệu theo ánh nắng rực rỡ và trải dài tận biên giới Tây Tạng.</p><div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">Beyond The Trail</span><a href="/ho-pangong-tso/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-stone-900 hover:bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors">Chi Tiết <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class="group relative flex flex-col bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.12)] transition-all duration-300 shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-[45%] md:w-[35%] lg:w-[28%] snap-center"><div class="relative h-48 md:h-56 w-full overflow-hidden shrink-0"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2021/11/ve-dep-cua-ho-Tso-Moriri-.webp" alt="Hồ Tso Moriri" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col flex-1"><div class="mb-4"><span class="bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Immersive Journey</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors">09. Hồ Tso Moriri</h3><p class="text-stone-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">Tuyệt tác hồ nước ngọt thiêng liêng ở độ cao 4.522m, yên bình, vắng lặng và ít dấu chân du khách hơn Pangong.</p><div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] text-stone-500 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest">Beyond The Trail</span><a href="/ho-tso-moriri/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-stone-900 hover:bg-black text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition-colors">Chi Tiết <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 ml-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6"><div class="bg-amber-50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-amber-200"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-utensils w-6 h-6 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 2v7c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2"></path><path d="M7 2v20"></path><path d="M21 15V2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v6c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h3Zm0 0v7"></path></svg>Ẩm Thực Địa Phương</h3><p class="text-sm text-amber-900/80 leading-relaxed text-justify">Thực đơn chủ yếu là thịt gà, cừu non (người dân không ăn thịt heo, bò). Đặc sản nên thử là Momo (sủi cảo kiểu Tạng), Thukpa (mì súp), Xiên cừu nướng và Trà Bơ (Butter Tea). Các nhà hàng ở Leh khá đa dạng, tuy nhiên khi di chuyển xa (Nubra, Pangong), đồ ăn thường đậm gia vị cà-ri Ấn Độ. Fit Tour luôn chuẩn bị sẵn ruốc, khô gà, mì gói Việt Nam để đổi vị.</p></div><div class="bg-stone-100 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tent w-6 h-6 text-stone-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 21 14 3"></path><path d="M20.5 21 10 3"></path><path d="M15.5 21 12 15l-3.5 6"></path><path d="M2 21h20"></path></svg>Lưu Trú &amp; Cắm Trại</h3><p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed text-justify">Tại trung tâm thị trấn Leh, khách sạn đạt chuẩn 3 sao dạng Lodge/Hut bằng gỗ, nệm êm và view núi rất đẹp. Tại những khu vực xa xôi (Thung lũng Nubra, Hồ Pangong, Tso Moriri), bạn sẽ được ngủ trong các khu Lều Trại (Glamping Tents) siêu tiện nghi, có nước nóng, chăn gối sạch sẽ và không gian ngắm dải ngân hà tuyệt mỹ.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative bg-stone-50 py-24 px-4 md:px-8 overflow-hidden border-y border-stone-200 font-sans my-16 rounded-3xl mx-2 md:mx-0"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center select-none pointer-events-none opacity-[0.03] z-0"><span class="font-serif text-[18vw] font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tighter uppercase whitespace-nowrap leading-none">NHẬT KÝ</span></div><div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/3 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-sky-500/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-end mb-16 pb-8 border-b border-stone-200"><div class="md:col-span-8"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold block mb-3 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg>THE EDITORIAL SPREAD / NHẬT KÝ HÀNH TRÌNH</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-none tracking-tight">"Cuộc Đời Là Một Cuốn Phim, Tôi Từ Chối Làm Khán Giả"</h2></div><div class="md:col-span-4 flex md:justify-end gap-3"><button class="flex flex-col items-start px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border text-left transition-all duration-300 min-w-[90px] cursor-pointer border-amber-600 bg-amber-50 text-amber-900 shadow-md"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold block">0<!-- -->1</span><span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-sans tracking-wider font-bold">Cô Mây U70</span></button><button class="flex flex-col items-start px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border text-left transition-all duration-300 min-w-[90px] cursor-pointer border-stone-200 bg-white text-stone-500 hover:border-stone-300 hover:text-stone-700 shadow-sm"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold block">0<!-- -->2</span><span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-sans tracking-wider font-bold">Khám Phá</span></button><button class="flex flex-col items-start px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg border text-left transition-all duration-300 min-w-[90px] cursor-pointer border-stone-200 bg-white text-stone-500 hover:border-stone-300 hover:text-stone-700 shadow-sm"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold block">0<!-- -->3</span><span class="text-[10px] uppercase font-sans tracking-wider font-bold">Motor Trip</span></button></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-8 order-2 lg:order-1"><div class="space-y-1"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase tracking-widest block">CHÂN DUNG KHẮC HỌA</span><p class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 leading-tight transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100">Cô Mây U70</p><div class="h-0.5 w-12 bg-amber-500 mt-2"></div></div><div class="space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-stone-600"><div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-200"><span>Bộ sưu tập</span><span class="text-stone-900 font-bold">Ladakh 2026</span></div><div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-200"><span>Hình thái</span><span class="text-stone-900 font-semibold">Tự truyện du ký</span></div><div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-200"><span>Độ cao trung bình</span><span class="text-stone-900 font-semibold">&gt;<!-- --> 3,500m</span></div><div class="flex justify-between py-1.5 border-b border-stone-200"><span>Chuyên mục</span><span class="text-stone-900 font-semibold">Nhật ký FIT Tour</span></div></div><div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm p-4 rounded-xl font-mono text-xs text-stone-600 space-y-2 transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-700 font-bold text-[10px]"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-amber-600 rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>BẢN ĐỒ TỌA ĐỘ</div><div><span class="text-stone-500 text-[10px] uppercase block">Ladakh GPS Point</span><span class="text-stone-900 font-bold">34.2787° N, 77.6047° E</span></div><div><span class="text-stone-500 text-[10px] uppercase block">Định danh</span><span class="text-stone-700 italic">Gió Lạnh Tuyết Trắng — 5,359m</span></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5 flex justify-center order-1 lg:order-2"><div class="relative aspect-3/4 w-full max-w-[370px] bg-stone-100 border-4 border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl shadow-xl p-4 overflow-hidden group transition-all duration-300 transform opacity-100 scale-100" style="box-shadow:0 25px 50px -12px rgba(218, 175, 90, 0.25)"><div class="absolute inset-2 border border-amber-500/40 rounded-xl z-20 pointer-events-none"></div><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/trai-nghiem-choi-tuyet-khardungla-ladakh.webp" alt="MÂY TRÊN ĐỈNH KHARDUNG LA" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700 brightness-[90%] scale-105 group-hover:scale-110"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-stone-950 via-stone-950/40 to-transparent z-10"></div><div class="absolute top-6 left-6 z-20 text-white font-serif pointer-events-none"><span class="font-mono text-[8px] uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-400 block font-bold">FIT TOUR EXCLUSIVE</span><h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight mt-0.5 drop-shadow">DIARY</h3></div><div class="absolute top-6 right-6 z-20 text-right font-mono text-[8px] text-white/90 pointer-events-none"><span>ISSUE 0<!-- -->1</span><span class="block mt-0.5 text-amber-400 font-bold bg-amber-400/20 px-1 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-400/40 uppercase">ACTIVE EXPLORER</span></div><div class="absolute bottom-6 inset-x-6 z-20 text-left pointer-events-none"><div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-[8px] text-amber-400 font-mono tracking-widest block mb-1"><span>PORTRAIT SPREAD</span><span>•</span><span>STORY</span></div><h4 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold leading-tight uppercase tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-md">MÂY TRÊN ĐỈNH KHARDUNG LA</h4><p class="font-sans text-[10px] text-stone-200 line-clamp-2 mt-1.5 italic font-medium leading-relaxed opacity-95">"<!-- -->Ở độ cao nghẹt thở này, hơi thở tôi mỏng mảnh nhưng khát khao của tôi lại dày dặn hơn bao giờ hết. Khi gió quất lạnh buốt, tôi tự hào vì gối mình không quỵ ngã.<!-- -->"</p></div><a href="/co-may" class="absolute inset-0 z-30 flex items-center justify-center opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-[3px]"><span class="px-6 py-3 border border-amber-600 text-stone-900 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest bg-white/95 hover:bg-amber-600 hover:text-white transition-colors rounded-full font-bold shadow-xl">Đọc Bài Viết</span></a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6 order-3"><div class="bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm p-6 md:p-8 rounded-2xl relative"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-quote w-8 h-8 text-amber-200 absolute top-4 left-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path><path d="M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z"></path></svg><h4 class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-stone-500 font-bold block mb-4">Trích Đoạn Hành Trình</h4><div class="space-y-4 transition-all duration-300 transform opacity-100 translate-y-0"><p class="font-serif text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed italic font-medium">"<!-- -->Ở độ cao nghẹt thở này, hơi thở tôi mỏng mảnh nhưng khát khao của tôi lại dày dặn hơn bao giờ hết. Khi gió quất lạnh buốt, tôi tự hào vì gối mình không quỵ ngã.<!-- -->"</p><div class="pt-4 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono"><span class="text-stone-500">Đọc toàn bộ bài viết</span><a href="/co-may" class="text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-600 underline font-bold block">Tại đây</a></div></div></div><div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 flex items-center justify-between transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100"><div><span class="font-mono text-[9px] text-amber-700 block font-bold">SIGNATURE OF MEMORY</span><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold italic text-amber-900 tracking-wide">Cloudy May • 1958</span></div><div class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-600 border border-stone-300 rounded px-2.5 py-1 text-center bg-white shadow-sm">Phượt thủ 68 tuổi</div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="chuan-bi" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-center text-stone-900 mb-12">Chuẩn Bị Hành Trang Trước Giờ G</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12"><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text w-6 h-6 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>Hồ Sơ Xin e-Visa Ấn Độ</h3><ul class="space-y-5"><li class="flex gap-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm">Hộ Chiếu Phổ Thông Gốc</h4><p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1">Còn hạn trên 6 tháng, tối thiểu 2 trang trống kế tiếp.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm">Ảnh Chân Dung File Số</h4><p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1">Vuông 5x5cm, phông nền trắng, không đeo kính, không hở răng.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm">Thẻ Thanh Toán Quốc Tế</h4><p class="text-xs text-stone-500 mt-1">Visa/Mastercard để thanh toán lệ phí 25 USD online.</p></div></li></ul><div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl text-xs font-mono text-stone-600 border border-stone-150">Xét duyệt: 48h - 72h làm việc. Khuyên nộp trước 20 ngày.</div></div><div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm"><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-briefcase w-6 h-6 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 20V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16"></path><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="6" rx="2"></rect></svg>Checklist Cá Nhân (Phải Có)</h3><div class="space-y-6"><div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm mb-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">Trang Phục Giữ Ấm 3 Lớp</h4><p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Áo giữ nhiệt ôm khít thân, Áo phao lông vũ chống gió/tuyết, Găng tay, Mũ len che tai, Tất len dày, Giày trekking chống trượt.</p></div><div><h4 class="font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm mb-2 border-b border-stone-100 pb-2">Đồ Điện &amp; Phụ Kiện</h4><p class="text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Phích cắm loại 2 đầu tròn (chuẩn WA-10), Ổ cắm nối dài (siêu quan trọng), Sạc dự phòng, Kính râm phân cực chống mù tuyết, Son dưỡng chống nẻ.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="bg-red-50 border-2 border-red-200 rounded-2xl p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-6"><div class="bg-red-100 text-red-600 p-4 rounded-full shrink-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cross w-10 h-10" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 9a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4a1 1 0 0 1-1 1z"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-red-700 font-bold text-xl mb-2 uppercase tracking-wide">Tuyệt Đối Không Mang Theo</h3><p class="text-red-900 font-medium leading-relaxed"><span class="font-bold">✕ Không mang Vape / Thuốc lá điện tử:</span> Luật Ấn Độ phạt rất nặng.<br><span class="font-bold">✕ Không mang bình xịt tuyết/tạo áp suất lớn:</span> Sẽ bị thu giữ tại sân bay. Bình xịt tóc nhỏ phải ký gửi.</p></div></div></section><section id="tour" class="scroll-mt-24"><div class="text-center mb-12"><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4">Lựa Chọn Hành Trình Tuyệt Bút</h2><p class="text-stone-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Được thiết kế tối ưu độ an toàn cho người Việt bởi FIT TOUR.</p></div><div class="relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto"><button aria-label="Previous slide" class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center bg-white text-stone-900 rounded-full cursor-poi