uration-300 bg-stone-850/60 hover:bg-stone-800 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3"><span class="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border-red-500/20">Y Khoa</span><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-400 font-semibold">1 vỉ</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-amber-400">Phòng say độ cao</h3><p class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5 mb-3">Thuốc AMS (Diamox)</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono"><span class="text-stone-400">Độ cần thiết:</span><span class="font-semibold text-rose-400">★★★ Cực kỳ cao</span></div></div><div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl p-5 border text-left transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-850/60 hover:bg-stone-800 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3"><span class="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-red-500/10 text-red-400 border-red-500/20">Y Khoa</span><span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-400 font-semibold">1 bình</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-amber-400">Oxy cá nhân</h3><p class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-400 mt-0.5 mb-3">Bình Oxy Mini</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono"><span class="text-stone-400">Độ cần thiết:</span><span class="font-semibold text-rose-400">★★★ Cực kỳ cao</span></div></div><div class="cursor-pointer rounded-xl p-5 border text-left transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-850/60 hover:bg-stone-800 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700" style="opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)"><div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-3"><span class="text-[9px] font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-sky-500/10 text-sky-400 border-sky-500/20">Thiết Yếu</span><span class="te