h-full object-cover grayscale-[35%] group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500 scale-102 group-hover:scale-106"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/40 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 flex items-center justify-center"><div class="bg-white/95 rounded-full p-2.5 shadow-md flex items-center gap-1"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye w-4 h-4 text-amber-800" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg><span class="text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-stone-800 pr-1">Chi Tiết</span></div></div></div><div class="mt-5 text-left pl-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-stone-600 text-[10px] font-mono mb-1.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin w-3 h-3 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>Góc núi đá</span><span>•</span><span class="flex items-center gap-0.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar w-3 h-3 text-amber-700" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Hoàng hôn</span></div><p class="font-serif text-sm font-medium text-stone-800 leading-relaxed italic line-clamp-2">"<!-- -->Vẻ đẹp nguyên sơ thách thức giới hạn con người.<!-- -->"</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-stone-100 border-t border-stone-200"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8"><div class="text-center mb-16"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-8 h-8 text-amber-500 mx-auto mb-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 mb-4">Hỏi Đáp (FAQ)</h2><p class="font-serif text-stone-600 italic">Những thắc mắc thường gặp nhất khi chuẩn bị hành trình chiêm ngưỡng vẻ đẹp Pangong Tso.</p></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-amber-500/50 shadow-md"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left"><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold transition-colors text-amber-800">Có được phép tắm ở hồ Pangong không?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-amber-100 text-amber-700"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300 rotate-180" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button><div style="height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="p-6 pt-0 text-stone-600 font-serif leading-relaxed text-justify border-t border-stone-100 mt-2">Không. Pangong Tso được người dân địa phương xem là hồ nước thiêng. Ngoài ra, nước hồ quanh năm cực kỳ lạnh và vì lý do sinh thái học mỏng manh, chính quyền địa phương cấm tuyệt đối mọi hoạt động tắm rửa hay xả rác xuống hồ.</div></div></div><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-200 hover:border-stone-300"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left"><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold transition-colors text-stone-800">Ngủ đêm tại Pangong có lạnh không?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-200 hover:border-stone-300"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left"><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold transition-colors text-stone-800">Di chuyển từ Leh đến Pangong Tso mất bao lâu?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="bg-white border rounded-xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-200 hover:border-stone-300"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left"><span class="font-serif text-lg font-bold transition-colors text-stone-800">Có cần xin giấy phép đặc biệt để đến hồ không?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-colors bg-stone-100 text-stone-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 transition-transform duration-300" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-stone-900 border-t border-amber-900/20 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/5 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-16"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square w-8 h-8 text-amber-500 mx-auto mb-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">Lưu bút khách hành hương</h2><p class="font-serif text-stone-400 italic">Cảm nhận từ những đôi chân từng đặt đến miền viễn biên Pangong Tso.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-700/50 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between"><p class="font-serif text-stone-300 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">"<!-- -->Nước hồ đổi màu thật vi diệu. Mình từng đến nhiều hồ nước đẹp trên thế giới nhưng vẻ hùng vĩ và tĩnh lặng của Pangong thực sự làm mình nghẹt thở!<!-- -->"</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-stone-700/50 pt-4"><div><div class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Phương Linh</div><div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase">Tháng 9, 2026</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg><span>124</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-700/50 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between"><p class="font-serif text-stone-300 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">"<!-- -->Trải nghiệm ngủ đêm tại Glamping của FIT Tour xuất sắc. Ban đêm tuyết rơi nhẹ bên ngoài lều nhưng bên trong ấm sực. Sáng dậy mở cửa thấy ngay dải ngân hà, không thể tin được!<!-- -->"</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-stone-700/50 pt-4"><div><div class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Hoàng Quân</div><div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase">Tháng 8, 2026</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg><span>89</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-700/50 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between"><p class="font-serif text-stone-300 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">"<!-- -->Khuyên mọi người đi đường cẩn thận và nhớ uống thuốc chống sốc độ cao. Bù lại cảnh ở khúc Shooting Point đẹp y chang trong phim 3 Chàng Ngốc.<!-- -->"</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-stone-700/50 pt-4"><div><div class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Bích Ngọc</div><div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase">Tháng 7, 2026</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg><span>210</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 text-center"><div class="inline-block p-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-300 to-amber-500"><button class="bg-stone-900 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-colors font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Chia sẻ câu chuyện của bạn</button></div><p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase mt-4 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">Pangong Tso - bức tranh ngoạn mục giữa lòng Himalaya. Từng con sóng nhỏ, từng tia nắng đều mang theo câu chuyện của thiên nhiên.</p></div></div></section><section class="relative py-24 px-4 bg-white border-t border-stone-200"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-12"><div><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold block mb-2">Đọc Thêm</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight">Có Thể Bạn Quan Tâm</h2></div><div class="hidden md:block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open w-8 h-8 text-stone-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 