t-[13px] mb-4">Land of the Lamas</p><p class="text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed text-[13px] mb-6 grow">Hành trình đầu tiên dành cho những ai muốn khám phá vẻ đẹp kinh điển của Ladakh.</p><div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5"><p class="text-stone-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed"><span class="text-white font-medium">Hành trình:</span> <!-- -->Leh • Nubra • Pangong • Khardung La • Tu viện cổ</p></div></div></a><a href="/tour/tour-ladakh-khoi-hanh-ha-noi" target="_blank" class="group block bg-[#050505] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/20 snap-center flex-shrink-0" style="width:380px;max-width:80vw"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-stone-900" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/bien-may-duoi-day-nui-himalaya-ladakh.webp" alt="02. LADAKH – Kingdom Above the Clouds" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700 ease-out" loading="lazy"><div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border border-white/10"><span class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-[9px] tracking-wider">Thám hiểm – Roadtrip – Ít người đặt chân tới</span></div></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col grow"><p class="font-bold uppercase mb-2 text-amber-500 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] font-mono">10N9Đ | Expedition Journey</p><h3 class="text-white font-serif text-lg mb-1.5 leading-tight">02. LADAKH – Kingdom Above the Clouds</h3><p class="text-stone-400 font-serif italic text-[13px] mb-4">Kashmir • Zanskar • Ladakh</p><p class="text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed text-[13px] mb-6 grow">Hành trình xuyên qua những vùng đất hùng vĩ và biệt lập nhất của Himalaya.</p><div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5"><p class="text-stone-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed"><span class="text-white font-medium">Hành trình:</span> <!-- -->Srinagar • Drass • Kargil • Zanskar • Leh</p></div></div></a><a href="/tour/tour-kashmir-zanskar" target="_blank" class="group block bg-[#050505] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/20 snap-center flex-shrink-0" style="width:380px;max-width:80vw"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-stone-900" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/nguoi-dan-gat-lua-ben-ho-ldakh.webp" alt="03. LIVING LADAKH" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700 ease-out" loading="lazy"><div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border border-white/10"><span class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-[9px] tracking-wider">Bản địa – Nhiếp ảnh – Trải nghiệm sâu</span></div></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col grow"><p class="font-bold uppercase mb-2 text-amber-500 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] font-mono">Immersive Journey</p><h3 class="text-white font-serif text-lg mb-1.5 leading-tight">03. LIVING LADAKH</h3><p class="text-stone-400 font-serif italic text-[13px] mb-4">Beyond the Tourist Trail</p><p class="text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed text-[13px] mb-6 grow">Dành cho những người muốn sống cùng Ladakh thay vì chỉ ghé thăm.</p><div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5"><p class="text-stone-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed"><span class="text-white font-medium">Hành trình:</span> <!-- -->Hanle • Changthang • Hồ Tso Moriri • Làng xa xôi</p></div></div></a><a href="/tour/tour-ladakh-mua-le-hoi-hemis" target="_blank" class="group block bg-[#050505] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/20 snap-center flex-shrink-0" style="width:380px;max-width:80vw"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-stone-900" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/co-gai-ben-tuong-trang-tu-vien-hemis.webp" alt="04. LADAKH – Path of the Pilgrims" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700 ease-out" loading="lazy"><div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border border-white/10"><span class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-[9px] tracking-wider">Phật giáo Himalaya – Văn hóa – Tâm linh</span></div></div><div class="p-6 flex flex-col grow"><p class="font-bold uppercase mb-2 text-amber-500 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] font-mono">Spiritual Journey</p><h3 class="text-white font-serif text-lg mb-1.5 leading-tight">04. LADAKH – Path of the Pilgrims</h3><p class="text-stone-400 font-serif italic text-[13px] mb-4">Journey to the Heart of Himalayan Buddhism</p><p class="text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed text-[13px] mb-6 grow">Hành trình theo dấu chân những người hành hương trên Con Đường Phật Giáo Himalaya.</p><div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-white/5"><p class="text-stone-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed"><span class="text-white font-medium">Hành trình:</span> <!-- -->Thiksey • Hemis • Alchi • Lamayuru • Diskit • Rizong</p></div></div></a><a href="/tour/tour-motor-ladakh-10n9d-chinh-phuc-deo-cao-nhat" target="_blank" class="group block bg-[#050505] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-white/5 hover:border-white/20 snap-center flex-shrink-0" style="width:380px;max-width:80vw"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-stone-900" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2023/10/motor-trip-ladakh-4.webp" alt="05. LADAKH MOTOR ADVENTURE" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700 ease-out" loading="lazy"><div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 border border-white/10"><span class="text-white font-bold uppercase text-[9px] tracking