ất thiêng Tây Tạng qua những tu viện hàng trăm năm tuổi.</p><div class="flex items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest mt-auto">Đọc ngay <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="/mac-gi-khi-di-du-lich-ladakh" target="_blank" class="group flex flex-col bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200/60 hover:border-amber-700/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden relative"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/co-gai-chup-anh-tren-xe-roadtrip-ladakh-truoc-tu-vien-thiksey.webp" alt="Mặc gì khi đi du lịch Ladakh để lên hình đẹp nhất?" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div></div><div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-500 mb-4"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Tháng 5, 2026</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>7 phút đọc</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">Mặc gì khi đi du lịch Ladakh để lên hình đẹp nhất?</h3><p class="text-sm font-sans text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">Ladakh có bảng màu đặc biệt, một bộ đồ phù hợp với bối cảnh sẽ tạo nên những bức ảnh để đời. Kinh nghiệm chọn trang phục roadtrip phóng khoáng.</p><div class="flex items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest mt-auto">Đọc ngay <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a></div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> <astro-island uid="25ziPA" prefix="r15" component-url="/_astro/SignatureTour.6LvzNFc_.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.8CyCEayk.js" props="{}" ssr="" client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;SignatureTour&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children=""><section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#0a0a0a] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 left-1/3 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-700/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 relative z-10"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12"><div><p class="text-amber-500 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4 font-mono">Những Hành Trình Độc Bản</p><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl 