-8 relative z-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-8 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-4 sticky top-24"><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center p-3 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl mb-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark w-8 h-8 text-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></div><h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-6">Câu Hỏi<br><span class="text-stone-400">Thường Gặp</span></h2><div class="w-16 h-1 bg-amber-500 mb-6"></div><p class="font-sans text-stone-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">Tất cả những gì bạn cần biết trước khi đặt chân đến Thung lũng Nubra. Từ lịch trình, chi phí, đến những lưu ý sức khỏe quan trọng nhất.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-4"><div class="bg-stone-850/50 backdrop-blur-sm border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-amber-500/50 shadow-lg shadow-amber-900/10"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left group"><span class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl font-bold pr-8 transition-colors text-amber-400">Nubra hay Pangong nên đi trước?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-amber-500 text-stone-900 rotate-180"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button><div style="height:0px;opacity:0"><div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-2 text-stone-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-justify mt-2"><p>Bạn <strong>nên đi Nubra trước</strong>. Nubra có độ cao trung bình khoảng 3.000m (thấp hơn Leh). Việc ngủ đêm tại một nơi thấp như Nubra sau khi vượt đèo Khardung La sẽ giúp cơ thể thích nghi độ cao (acclimatization) cực kỳ hiệu quả, chuẩn bị tốt cho việc ngủ ở Pangong (cao hơn 4.200m) sau đó.</p></div></div></div><div class="bg-stone-850/50 backdrop-blur-sm border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-850"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left group"><span class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl font-bold pr-8 transition-colors text-stone-200 group-hover:text-white">Có nên ở Nubra 1 hay 2 đêm?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700 group-hover:text-stone-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="bg-stone-850/50 backdrop-blur-sm border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-850"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left group"><span class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl font-bold pr-8 transition-colors text-stone-200 group-hover:text-white">Có nên ngủ Hunder hay Diskit?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700 group-hover:text-stone-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="bg-stone-850/50 backdrop-blur-sm border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-850"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left group"><span class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl font-bold pr-8 transition-colors text-stone-200 group-hover:text-white">Thung lũng Nubra nằm ở đâu?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700 group-hover:text-stone-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="bg-stone-850/50 backdrop-blur-sm border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-850"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left group"><span class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl font-bold pr-8 transition-colors text-stone-200 group-hover:text-white">Làm thế nào để đến Thung lũng Nubra?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700 group-hover:text-stone-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class="bg-stone-850/50 backdrop-blur-sm border rounded-2xl overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border-stone-800 hover:border-stone-700 hover:bg-stone-850"><button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between p-6 text-left group"><span class="font-serif text-lg md:text-xl font-bold pr-8 transition-colors text-stone-200 group-hover:text-white">Thời gian tốt nhất để tham quan Thung lũng Nubra là khi nào?</span><div class="shrink-0 p-2 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 bg-stone-800 text-stone-400 group-hover:bg-stone-700 group-hover:text-stone-200"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-5 h-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> <astro-island uid="ZjH6sH" prefix="r15" component-url="/_astro/Guestbook.DyL731Ew.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.8CyCEayk.js" props="{}" ssr="" client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Guestbook&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children=""><section class="py-24 bg-stone-900 border-t border-amber-900/20 relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/5 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 relative z-10"><div class="text-center mb-16"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square w-8 h-8 text-amber-500 mx-auto mb-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">Lưu bút khách hành hương</h2><p class="font-serif text-stone-400 italic">Cảm nhận từ những đôi chân từng đặt đến miền viễn biên Tso Moriri Tso.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-700/50 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between"><p class="font-serif text-stone-300 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">"<!-- -->Nước hồ đổi màu thật vi diệu. Mình từng đến nhiều hồ nước đẹp trên thế giới nhưng vẻ hùng vĩ và tĩnh lặng của Tso Moriri thực sự làm mình nghẹt thở!<!-- -->"</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-stone-700/50 pt-4"><div><div class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Phương Linh</div><div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase">Tháng 9, 2026</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg><span>124</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-700/50 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between"><p class="font-serif text-stone-300 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">"<!-- -->Trải nghiệm ngủ đêm tại Glamping của FIT Tour xuất sắc. Ban đêm tuyết rơi nhẹ bên ngoài lều nhưng bên trong ấm sực. Sáng dậy mở cửa thấy ngay dải ngân hà, không thể tin được!<!-- -->"</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-stone-700/50 pt-4"><div><div class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Hoàng Quân</div><div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase">Tháng 8, 2026</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg><span>89</span></div></div></div><div class="bg-stone-800/50 border border-stone-700/50 p-6 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between"><p class="font-serif text-stone-300 italic leading-relaxed mb-6">"<!-- -->Khuyên mọi người đi đường cẩn thận và nhớ uống thuốc chống sốc độ cao. Bù lại cảnh ở khúc Shooting Point đẹp y chang trong phim 3 Chàng Ngốc.<!-- -->"</p><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-stone-700/50 pt-4"><div><div class="text-white font-bold text-sm">Bích Ngọc</div><div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase">Tháng 7, 2026</div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-500 bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-heart w-3 h-3 fill-amber-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5"></path></svg><span>210</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-16 text-center"><div class="inline-block p-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-300 to-amber-500"><button class="bg-stone-900 hover:bg-stone-800 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-colors font-sans text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Chia sẻ câu chuyện của bạn</button></div><p class="font-mono text-[10px] text-stone-500 uppercase mt-4 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">Tso Moriri Tso - bức tranh ngoạn mục giữa lòng Himalaya. Từng con sóng nhỏ, từng tia nắng đều mang theo câu chuyện của thiên nhiên.</p></div></div></section><!--astro:end--></astro-island> <astro-island uid="2lu3OC" prefix="r16" component-url="/_astro/RelatedArticles.ZHpWyaVE.js" component-export="default" renderer-url="/_astro/client.8CyCEayk.js" props="{}" ssr="" client="visible" opts="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;RelatedArticles&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:true}" await-children=""><section class="relative py-24 px-4 bg-white border-t border-stone-200"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-12"><div><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-amber-700 font-bold block mb-2">Đọc Thêm</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight">Có Thể Bạn Quan Tâm</h2></div><div class="hidden md:block"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open w-8 h-8 text-stone-200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><a href="/vi-sao-ladakh-duoc-goi-la-tieu-tay-tang" target="_blank" class="group flex flex-col bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200/60 hover:border-amber-700/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden relative"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/2023/06/Dang-Thuy-Duong-kham-pha-tu-vien-Hemis.webp" alt="Vì Sao Ladakh Được Gọi Là Tiểu Tây Tạng Của Ấn Độ?" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-stone-900/10 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors duration-300"></div></div><div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col flex-grow"><div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[10px] font-mono text-stone-500 mb-4"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v4"></path><path d="M16 2v4"></path><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Tháng 6, 2026</span><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path></svg>10 phút đọc</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-amber-800 transition-colors">Vì Sao Ladakh Được Gọi Là Tiểu Tây Tạng Của Ấn Độ?</h3><p class="text-sm font-sans text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-grow">Khám phá sự tương đồng sâu sắc về địa lý, văn hóa, tôn giáo và lối sống với vùng đất thiêng Tây Tạng qua những tu viện hàng trăm năm tuổi.</p><div class="flex items-center text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-700 uppercase tracking-widest mt-auto">Đọc ngay <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4 ml-2 transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="/mac-gi-khi-di-du-lich-ladakh" target="_blank" class="group flex flex-col bg-stone-50 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-200/60 hover:border-amber-700/30 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-1"><div class="aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden relative"><img src="https://media.fittour.vn/uploads/co-gai-chup-anh-tren-xe-roadtrip-ladakh-truoc-tu-vien-thiksey.webp" alt="Mặc gì khi